{"id":3867,"date":"2024-12-01T12:01:56","date_gmt":"2024-12-01T04:01:56","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=3867"},"modified":"2024-12-01T13:31:24","modified_gmt":"2024-12-01T05:31:24","slug":"disc-filter-cloth","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?product=disc-filter-cloth","title":{"rendered":"Disc Filter Cloth"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"product-post\" data-elementor-id=\"3867\" class=\"elementor elementor-3867\" data-elementor-post-type=\"product\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2391251 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"2391251\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b2bb1df elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b2bb1df\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The vacuum disc filter is a solid-liquid separation device that uses vacuum as the filtering power to separate the slurry into solids and liquids. The machine adopts advanced technologies such as filter disc guide frame guidance, variable speed stirring, back-blowing unloading, automatic centralized lubrication, etc. It is a dehydration equipment with excellent performance and reliable use.<\/p><p>Cake forming takes place on the discs when they rotate through the slurry. As the disc filter rotates, the cake is dried by removing the liquid and is discharged from the cloth at the end of this zone by means of compressed air. The cake then drops into the discharge chute.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e64daf9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"e64daf9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"703\" height=\"393\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Working-principle-of-disc-filter-detail1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3874\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Working-principle-of-disc-filter-detail1.jpg 703w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Working-principle-of-disc-filter-detail1-300x168.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Working-principle-of-disc-filter-detail1-600x335.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 703px) 100vw, 703px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f0b16b5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f0b16b5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Product Features<\/h3><ul><li><strong>High efficiency, precise filtration<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p>Specially structured filtration technology, precise and sensitive performance, ensures that only particles with a particle size smaller than the required size can enter the system, and is the most effective filtration system; users can choose different filtration precisions according to water requirements, and can provide precision filtration up to 5\u03bcm.<\/p><ul><li><strong>Wide adaptability<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p>Can easily handle various industrial water, sewage, surface water, river water, well water and other water sources.<\/p><ul><li><strong>Low consumption<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p>High-speed and thorough backwashing, which can be completed in just tens of seconds. The backwashing water consumption is very small, accounting for only 0.5% of the water output; if combined with air-assisted backwashing, the self-consumption water can be reduced to less than 0.2%.<\/p><ul><li><strong>Long service life<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p>Good wear resistance and corrosion resistance, after years of industrial practical verification, the filtration and backwashing effects will not deteriorate due to the use time.<\/p><hr \/><h3>Disc Filter Cloth Selection<\/h3><p>NTL1311 fabric texture has elastic and groove structure.<\/p><ul><li>NTL1311 groove structure increase surface friction can capture more solid.<\/li><li>The groove structure has a guided liquid function, can extremely dry cake.<\/li><li>Elastic can lead groove structure open in positive pressure, benefit to release cakes.<\/li><\/ul><hr \/><h3>Technical Parameter of Disc Filter Cloth<\/h3><table><tbody><tr><td width=\"86\">Product Code<\/td><td width=\"71\">Material<\/td><td width=\"97\">Yarn Type<\/td><td width=\"81\">Weight (g\/m\u00b2)<\/td><td width=\"88\">Thickness (mm)<\/td><td width=\"143\">Air Permeability<p>\u00a0<\/p><p>(L\/m\u00b2\/S @200pa)<\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"86\">ES-NTL1311<\/td><td width=\"71\">PA<\/td><td width=\"97\">Multi\/Multi<\/td><td width=\"81\">480<\/td><td width=\"88\">1.62<\/td><td width=\"143\">280<\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"86\">ES-NXM<\/td><td width=\"71\">PA<\/td><td width=\"97\">Mono\/Mono<\/td><td width=\"81\">420<\/td><td width=\"88\">0.6<\/td><td width=\"143\">950<\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"86\">ES-750B<\/td><td width=\"71\">PP<\/td><td width=\"97\">Multi\/Multi<\/td><td width=\"81\">420<\/td><td width=\"88\">0.85<\/td><td width=\"143\">65<\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"86\">ES-YLJ-S<\/td><td width=\"71\">PP<\/td><td width=\"97\">Mono\/Mono<\/td><td width=\"81\">310<\/td><td width=\"88\">0.56<\/td><td width=\"143\">100<\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"86\">ES-YLJ-T40<\/td><td width=\"71\">PP<\/td><td width=\"97\">Mono\/Mono<\/td><td width=\"81\">330<\/td><td width=\"88\">0.52<\/td><td width=\"143\">40<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><h3>Applications<\/h3><ul><li><strong>Mining<\/strong>: Separation of minerals from slurry in processes like iron ore filtration.<\/li><li><strong>Wastewater Treatment<\/strong>: Removing solids and debris from liquid waste streams.<\/li><li><strong>Chemical Processing<\/strong>: Filtering chemicals and solvents in industrial processes.<\/li><li><strong>Pulp and Paper<\/strong>: Dewatering pulp and recovering fibers.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0a2d0e7 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"0a2d0e7\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1b5b4d8 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"1b5b4d8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Disc-Filter-01-detail2.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3875\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Disc-Filter-01-detail2.jpg 750w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Disc-Filter-01-detail2-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Disc-Filter-01-detail2-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6a1c29e elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"6a1c29e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Disc-Filter-02-detail3.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3876\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/1